{
  "name": "Pinterest WF3 - Verify Published via Metricool",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pinterest – Workflow 3: Verify published pins\n\nReads rows where **Status = Scheduled** (with a Metricool Post ID) from **both** the **Pinterest Pins** tab (blog-sourced) and the **Pinterest2:3 Pins** tab (product-photo-sourced), calls Metricool **Get Post**, and when the post's Pinterest provider status is **PUBLISHED**, writes the real **Pinterest URL** (from `publicUrl`) into **Pin URL** and sets **Status = Published** + **Pinned Time** back to whichever tab that row came from (tracked internally as `_sourceTab`).\n\n**Setup:** Google Sheets + Metricool (Header Auth, X-Mc-Auth) credentials; userId, blogId, pinsTab, and pinsTab2 in Set Config.",
        "height": 476,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "e6ab377d-7023-433c-a4f2-f99c2dba48a4",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        10192,
        1040
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "triggerAtMinute": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
